      "text": "themselves is missing the most important"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0040",
      "start": 84.64,
      "end": 88.68,
      "duration": 4.04,
      "text": "thing. And that the most important thing"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0041",
      "start": 86.76,
      "end": 92.28,
      "duration": 5.52,
      "text": "is almost always on the other side of"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0042",
      "start": 88.68,
      "end": 92.28,
      "duration": 3.6,
      "text": "something uncomfortable."
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0043",
      "start": 92.4,
      "end": 96.28,
      "duration": 3.88,
      "text": "Most people live inside a plan they"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0044",
      "start": 94.08,
      "end": 98,
      "duration": 3.92,
      "text": "never actually made. A job that pays"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0045",
      "start": 96.28,
      "end": 100.64,
      "duration": 4.36,
      "text": "well enough. A city they know how to"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0046",
      "start": 98,
      "end": 103,
      "duration": 5,
      "text": "navigate. Restaurants they like. Routes"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0047",
      "start": 100.64,
      "end": 105.2,
      "duration": 4.56,
      "text": "they've memorized. Routines that make"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0048",
      "start": 103,
      "end": 107,
      "duration": 4,
      "text": "the days feel manageable. A life that"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0049",
      "start": 105.2,
      "end": 108.44,
      "duration": 3.24,
      "text": "when you describe it to someone sounds"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0050",
      "start": 107,
      "end": 111.12,
      "duration": 4.12,
      "text": "completely"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0051",
      "start": 108.44,
      "end": 112.88,
      "duration": 4.44,
      "text": "fine. Fine is the word that keeps coming"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0052",
      "start": 111.12,
      "end": 115.16,
      "duration": 4.04,
      "text": "up. And the thing about fine is it"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0053",
      "start": 112.88,
      "end": 117.92,
      "duration": 5.04,
      "text": "doesn't alarm anyone. It doesn't raise"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0054",
      "start": 115.16,
      "end": 119.64,
      "duration": 4.48,
      "text": "any flags. It's comfortable and clean"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0055",
      "start": 117.92,
      "end": 122.84,
      "duration": 4.92,
      "text": "and completely sufficient, and it will"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0056",
      "start": 119.64,
      "end": 124.72,
      "duration": 5.08,
      "text": "carry you from your 20s to your 50s"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0057",
      "start": 122.84,
      "end": 126.64,
      "duration": 3.8,
      "text": "without ever once making you feel like"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0058",
      "start": 124.72,
      "end": 128.16,
      "duration": 3.44,
      "text": "something is wrong right up until the"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0059",
      "start": 126.64,
      "end": 130.4,
      "duration": 3.76,
      "text": "moment you realize that nothing"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0060",
      "start": 128.16,
      "end": 132,
      "duration": 3.84,
      "text": "surprising has happened to you in years."
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0061",
      "start": 130.4,
      "end": 133.72,
      "duration": 3.32,
      "text": "Most people plan the surprising out of"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0062",
      "start": 132,
      "end": 136.12,
      "duration": 4.12,
      "text": "their lives without meaning to. They"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0063",
      "start": 133.72,
      "end": 138.16,
      "duration": 4.44,
      "text": "make sensible choices. They take the job"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0064",
      "start": 136.12,
      "end": 140.12,
      "duration": 4,
      "text": "that makes obvious sense instead of the"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0065",
      "start": 138.16,
      "end": 142.04,
      "duration": 3.88,
      "text": "one they're not sure they can do. They"
    },
