    {
      "id": "seg-0075",
      "start": 161.44,
      "end": 165.12,
      "duration": 3.68,
      "text": "a kitchen that ran the way he wanted."
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0076",
      "start": 163.48,
      "end": 166.92,
      "duration": 3.44,
      "text": "And two failed novels in a drawer"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0077",
      "start": 165.12,
      "end": 168.64,
      "duration": 3.52,
      "text": "somewhere and a writing dream he'd"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0078",
      "start": 166.92,
      "end": 170.32,
      "duration": 3.4,
      "text": "mostly made his peace with. From the"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0079",
      "start": 168.64,
      "end": 172.52,
      "duration": 3.88,
      "text": "outside, it looked like a man who had"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0080",
      "start": 170.32,
      "end": 174.4,
      "duration": 4.08,
      "text": "figured out what he was and accepted it."
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0081",
      "start": 172.52,
      "end": 176.28,
      "duration": 3.76,
      "text": "What actually happened is that he got"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0082",
      "start": 174.4,
      "end": 178.2,
      "duration": 3.8,
      "text": "bored enough to stop [music] playing it"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0083",
      "start": 176.28,
      "end": 179.24,
      "duration": 2.96,
      "text": "safe and do something that made no"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0084",
      "start": 178.2,
      "end": 182.32,
      "duration": 4.12,
      "text": "obvious sense."
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0085",
      "start": 179.24,
      "end": 183.64,
      "duration": 4.4,
      "text": ">> Be open to experience."
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0086",
      "start": 182.32,
      "end": 186.36,
      "duration": 4.04,
      "text": "Be willing to [music] try new things."
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0087",
      "start": 183.64,
      "end": 188.88,
      "duration": 5.24,
      "text": "Don't have a rigid plan. Accept random"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0088",
      "start": 186.36,
      "end": 190.92,
      "duration": 4.56,
      "text": "acts of hospitality without judgment or"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0089",
      "start": 188.88,
      "end": 193.28,
      "duration": 4.4,
      "text": "fear. Don't be afraid to wander. Don't"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0090",
      "start": 190.92,
      "end": 195.2,
      "duration": 4.28,
      "text": "be afraid [music] to eat a bad meal. You"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0091",
      "start": 193.28,
      "end": 196.24,
      "duration": 2.96,
      "text": "know, if you don't risk the bad meal,"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0092",
      "start": 195.2,
      "end": 198.04,
      "duration": 2.84,
      "text": "you'll never get the magical [music]"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0093",
      "start": 196.24,
      "end": 200.32,
      "duration": 4.08,
      "text": "one. But I think most important, you"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0094",
      "start": 198.04,
      "end": 201.08,
      "duration": 3.04,
      "text": "know, be humble. Be grateful. Be aware"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0095",
      "start": 200.32,
      "end": 202.8,
      "duration": 2.48,
      "text": "of the [music] fact that you are"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0096",
      "start": 201.08,
      "end": 203.8,
      "duration": 2.72,
      "text": "probably the stupidest person in the"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0097",
      "start": 202.8,
      "end": 205.8,
      "duration": 3,
      "text": "room."
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0098",
      "start": 203.8,
      "end": 207.92,
      "duration": 4.12,
      "text": "As far as you are the least prepared,"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0099",
      "start": 205.8,
      "end": 209.32,
