      "text": "least equipped person"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0100",
      "start": 207.92,
      "end": 210.92,
      "duration": 3,
      "text": "to know"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0101",
      "start": 209.32,
      "end": 211.96,
      "duration": 2.64,
      "text": "who's really in charge of what's really"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0102",
      "start": 210.92,
      "end": 214.04,
      "duration": 3.12,
      "text": "going on."
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0103",
      "start": 211.96,
      "end": 216.12,
      "duration": 4.16,
      "text": ">> The rigid plan is not just a travel"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0104",
      "start": 214.04,
      "end": 217.96,
      "duration": 3.92,
      "text": "problem. It's the version of yourself"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0105",
      "start": 216.12,
      "end": 220.32,
      "duration": 4.2,
      "text": "that already knows what you're capable"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0106",
      "start": 217.96,
      "end": 222.48,
      "duration": 4.52,
      "text": "of and arranges your life accordingly."
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0107",
      "start": 220.32,
      "end": 224.76,
      "duration": 4.44,
      "text": "It sets the ceiling before you've hit"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0108",
      "start": 222.48,
      "end": 227,
      "duration": 4.52,
      "text": "it. It builds the box before you've run"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0109",
      "start": 224.76,
      "end": 229.2,
      "duration": 4.44,
      "text": "out of room. And it does all of it with"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0110",
      "start": 227,
      "end": 231,
      "duration": 4,
      "text": "perfectly reasonable justifications,"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0111",
      "start": 229.2,
      "end": 233.56,
      "duration": 4.36,
      "text": "which is exactly what makes it so hard"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0112",
      "start": 231,
      "end": 236.04,
      "duration": 5.04,
      "text": "to argue with. Bourdain's essay had no"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0113",
      "start": 233.56,
      "end": 238.2,
      "duration": 4.64,
      "text": "business landing where it did. His"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0114",
      "start": 236.04,
      "end": 240.72,
      "duration": 4.68,
      "text": "resume for that submission was two"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0115",
      "start": 238.2,
      "end": 242.76,
      "duration": 4.56,
      "text": "novels nobody bought and 20 years of"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0116",
      "start": 240.72,
      "end": 244.72,
      "duration": 4,
      "text": "cooking professionally. The New Yorker"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0117",
      "start": 242.76,
      "end": 246.28,
      "duration": 3.52,
      "text": "published it anyway. The plan can't"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0118",
      "start": 244.72,
      "end": 248.96,
      "duration": 4.24,
      "text": "account for the things that haven't"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0119",
      "start": 246.28,
      "end": 248.96,
      "duration": 2.68,
      "text": "happened yet. [music]"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0120",
      "start": 249.4,
      "end": 254.6,
      "duration": 5.2,
      "text": "The bad meal is a specific concept. Take"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0121",
      "start": 251.96,
      "end": 256.68,
      "duration": 4.72,
      "text": "risks. Step outside your comfort zone."
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0122",
      "start": 254.6,
      "end": 258.64,
      "duration": 4.04,
      "text": "Embrace failure. All language that's"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0123",
      "start": 256.68,
      "end": 260.8,
      "duration": 4.12,
      "text": "been said so many times it's become"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0124",
      "start": 258.64,
      "end": 263.12,
      "duration": 4.48,
      "text": "background noise. Bourdain was not"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0125",
      "start": 260.8,
      "end": 265.16,
      "duration": 4.36,
      "text": "talking abstractly. He was talking about"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0126",
      "start": 263.12,
      "end": 267.12,
      "duration": 4,
      "text": "the fermented shark in Iceland that"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0127",
      "start": 265.16,
      "end": 268.96,
      "duration": 3.8,
      "text": "smells like ammonia and tastes like"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0128",
      "start": 267.12,
      "end": 270.76,
      "duration": 3.64,
      "text": "something that should not legally be"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0129",
      "start": 268.96,
      "end": 273.52,
      "duration": 4.56,
      "text": "food. The unmarked restaurant [music]"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0130",
      "start": 270.76,
      "end": 276.4,
      "duration": 5.64,
      "text": "down the alley in Hanoi with no menu and"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0131",
      "start": 273.52,
      "end": 278.4,
      "duration": 4.88,
      "text": "no prices and no clear indication that"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0132",
      "start": 276.4,
      "end": 281.12,
      "duration": 4.72,
      "text": "what you're about to eat won't make you"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0133",
      "start": 278.4,
      "end": 283.48,
      "duration": 5.08,
      "text": "sick for a week. Things he actually did"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0134",
      "start": 281.12,
      "end": 285.44,
      "duration": 4.32,
      "text": "repeatedly on purpose because he"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0135",
      "start": 283.48,
      "end": 287.4,
      "duration": 3.92,
      "text": "believed that the physical experience of"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0136",
      "start": 285.44,
      "end": 290.2,
      "duration": 4.76,
      "text": "committing to something you weren't sure"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0137",
      "start": 287.4,
      "end": 292.04,
      "duration": 4.64,
      "text": "about was the entire point. The bad meal"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0138",
      "start": 290.2,
      "end": 294.4,
      "duration": 4.2,
      "text": "is not a metaphor for failure. It's a"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0139",
      "start": 292.04,
      "end": 296.12,
      "duration": 4.08,
      "text": "metaphor for the moment before you know"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0140",
      "start": 294.4,
      "end": 298.68,
      "duration": 4.28,
      "text": "how something is going to go. The job"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0141",
      "start": 296.12,
      "end": 300.96,
      "duration": 4.84,
      "text": "you weren't sure you were qualified for."
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0142",
      "start": 298.68,
      "end": 302.84,
      "duration": 4.16,
      "text": "The move to a city where you don't know"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0143",
      "start": 300.96,
      "end": 304.96,
      "duration": 4,
      "text": "anyone. All of it lives in the same"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0144",
      "start": 302.84,
      "end": 306.68,
      "duration": 3.84,
      "text": "category. All of it requires the same"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0145",
      "start": 304.96,
      "end": 308,
      "duration": 3.04,
      "text": "thing, which is the willingness to eat"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0146",
      "start": 306.68,
      "end": 310.08,
      "duration": 3.4,
      "text": "something before you know whether it's"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0147",
      "start": 308,
      "end": 312.12,
      "duration": 4.12,
      "text": "going to be terrible or the best thing"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0148",
      "start": 310.08,
      "end": 313.96,
      "duration": 3.88,
      "text": "you've ever tasted. Most people skip"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0149",
      "start": 312.12,
      "end": 315.68,
      "duration": 3.56,
      "text": "this moment. They read the reviews"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0150",
      "start": 313.96,
      "end": 317.32,
      "duration": 3.36,
      "text": "first. They eliminate as much"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0151",
      "start": 315.68,
      "end": 319.4,
      "duration": 3.72,
      "text": "uncertainty as possible before"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0152",
      "start": 317.32,
      "end": 321.2,
      "duration": 3.88,
      "text": "committing, which feels like wisdom and"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0153",
      "start": 319.4,
      "end": 322.88,
      "duration": 3.48,
      "text": "is actually just a very sophisticated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0154",
      "start": 321.2,
      "end": 324.84,
      "duration": 3.64,
      "text": "way of making sure you never"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0155",
      "start": 322.88,
      "end": 326.92,
      "duration": 4.04,
      "text": "accidentally stumble into something"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0156",
      "start": 324.84,
      "end": 329.16,
      "duration": 4.32,
      "text": "extraordinary. [music] Bourdain's career"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0157",
      "start": 326.92,
      "end": 331.48,
      "duration": 4.56,
      "text": "is basically a long argument against"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0158",
      "start": 329.16,
      "end": 333.32,
      "duration": 4.16,
      "text": "research. He showed up to places he knew"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0159",
      "start": 331.48,
      "end": 335.8,
      "duration": 4.32,
      "text": "nothing about and figured it out from"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0160",
      "start": 333.32,
      "end": 337.48,
      "duration": 4.16,
      "text": "there. He sat down at tables with people"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0161",
      "start": 335.8,
      "end": 339.29,
      "duration": 3.49,
      "text": "whose names he couldn't pronounce in"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0162",
      "start": 337.48,
      "end": 339.32,
      "duration": 1.84,
      "text": "languages he didn't speak"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0163",
      "start": 339.29,
      "end": 340.96,
      "duration": 1.67,
      "text": ">> [music]"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0164",
      "start": 339.32,
      "end": 343.12,
      "duration": 3.8,
      "text": ">> and ate whatever they put in front of"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0165",
      "start": 340.96,
      "end": 345.08,
      "duration": 4.12,
      "text": "him. Not because he was fearless. He"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0166",
      "start": 343.12,
      "end": 347.04,
      "duration": 3.92,
      "text": "talked about fear constantly, but"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0167",
      "start": 345.08,
      "end": 349.6,
      "duration": 4.52,
      "text": "because he understood that fear was the"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0168",
      "start": 347.04,
      "end": 351.28,
      "duration": 4.24,
      "text": "tax you paid on everything worth doing"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0169",
      "start": 349.6,
      "end": 353.12,
      "duration": 3.52,
      "text": "and there was no way around it, only"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0170",
      "start": 351.28,
      "end": 355.52,
      "duration": 4.24,
      "text": "through it. The thing he kept coming"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0171",
      "start": 353.12,
      "end": 357.92,
      "duration": 4.8,
      "text": "back to was the idea that the experience"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0172",
      "start": 355.52,
      "end": 360.52,
      "duration": 5,
      "text": "itself was the point, not the"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0173",
      "start": 357.92,
      "end": 363.52,
      "duration": 5.6,
      "text": "destination, not the story you get to"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0174",
      "start": 360.52,
      "end": 366.08,
      "duration": 5.56,
      "text": "tell afterward. The actual experience of"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0175",
      "start": 363.52,
      "end": 368.68,
      "duration": 5.16,
      "text": "being somewhere unfamiliar and not"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0176",
      "start": 366.08,
      "end": 370.84,
      "duration": 4.76,
      "text": "knowing how it was going to go. The bad"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0177",
      "start": 368.68,
      "end": 373.44,
      "duration": 4.76,
      "text": "meal isn't something you survive on the"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0178",
      "start": 370.84,
      "end": 376.12,
      "duration": 5.28,
      "text": "way to the good one. The bad meal is the"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0179",
      "start": 373.44,
      "end": 379.04,
      "duration": 5.6,
      "text": "whole lesson. Discomfort is the"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0180",
      "start": 376.12,
      "end": 379.04,
      "duration": 2.92,
      "text": "education."
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0181",
      "start": 379.12,
      "end": 382.76,
      "duration": 3.64,
      "text": ">> If I do have any advice for anybody, any"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0182",
      "start": 381.32,
      "end": 385.64,
      "duration": 4.32,
      "text": "final thought, [music] if I'm an"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0183",
      "start": 382.76,
      "end": 388.28,
      "duration": 5.52,
      "text": "advocate for anything, it's to move as"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0184",
      "start": 385.64,
      "end": 390.64,
      "duration": 5,
      "text": "far as you can, as much as you can."
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0185",
      "start": 388.28,
      "end": 392.36,
      "duration": 4.08,
      "text": "Across the ocean or simply across the"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0186",
      "start": 390.64,
      "end": 394.28,
      "duration": 3.64,
      "text": "river. [music] The extent to which you"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0187",
      "start": 392.36,
      "end": 397,
      "duration": 4.64,
      "text": "can walk in somebody else's shoes or at"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0188",
      "start": 394.28,
      "end": 398.52,
      "duration": 4.24,
      "text": "least eat their food, it's a plus for"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0189",
      "start": 397,
      "end": 400.16,
      "duration": 3.16,
      "text": "everybody."
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0190",
      "start": 398.52,
      "end": 402.08,
      "duration": 3.56,
      "text": "Open your mind."
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0191",
      "start": 400.16,
      "end": 403.52,
      "duration": 3.36,
      "text": "Get up off the couch."
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0192",
      "start": 402.08,
      "end": 405.32,
      "duration": 3.24,
      "text": "Move."
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0193",
      "start": 403.52,
      "end": 406.8,
      "duration": 3.28,
      "text": ">> Most people are closer to the other side"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0194",
      "start": 405.32,
      "end": 408.4,
      "duration": 3.08,
      "text": "of the world than they think. The"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0195",
      "start": 406.8,
      "end": 410.52,
      "duration": 3.72,
      "text": "neighborhood they've driven past a"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0196",
      "start": 408.4,
      "end": 412.76,
      "duration": 4.36,
      "text": "hundred times and never walked through."
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0197",
      "start": 410.52,
      "end": 414.32,
      "duration": 3.8,
      "text": "The restaurant with no English menu. The"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0198",
      "start": 412.76,
      "end": 415.72,
      "duration": 2.96,
      "text": "conversation they've been avoiding"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0199",
      "start": 414.32,
      "end": 417.96,
      "duration": 3.64,
      "text": "because they already know it's going to"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0200",
      "start": 415.72,
      "end": 420.48,
      "duration": 4.76,
      "text": "be uncomfortable. All of it is the other"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0201",
      "start": 417.96,
      "end": 422.6,
      "duration": 4.64,
      "text": "side of the world. All of it requires"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0202",
      "start": 420.48,
      "end": 424.36,
      "duration": 3.88,
      "text": "the same thing. The willingness to show"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0203",
      "start": 422.6,
      "end": 426.52,
      "duration": 3.92,
      "text": "up somewhere you don't entirely know"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0204",
      "start": 424.36,
      "end": 428.72,
      "duration": 4.36,
      "text": "what you're doing and stay long enough"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0205",
      "start": 426.52,
      "end": 431.32,
      "duration": 4.8,
      "text": "to find out. Most people have already"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0206",
      "start": 428.72,
      "end": 433.2,
      "duration": 4.48,
      "text": "decided how they feel about the places"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0207",
      "start": 431.32,
      "end": 435.52,
      "duration": 4.2,
      "text": "they've never been, the food they've"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0208",
      "start": 433.2,
      "end": 437.52,
      "duration": 4.32,
      "text": "never eaten, the people whose lives look"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0209",
      "start": 435.52,
      "end": 439.4,
      "duration": 3.88,
      "text": "nothing like theirs. They formed that"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0210",
      "start": 437.52,
      "end": 441.4,
      "duration": 3.88,
      "text": "opinion from a distance and they're"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0211",
      "start": 439.4,
      "end": 444.16,
      "duration": 4.76,
      "text": "keeping it because going to actually"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0212",
      "start": 441.4,
      "end": 445.96,
      "duration": 4.56,
      "text": "look means risking being wrong. And"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0213",
      "start": 444.16,
      "end": 448.24,
      "duration": 4.08,
      "text": "being wrong about something you've held"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0214",
      "start": 445.96,
      "end": 450.08,
      "duration": 4.12,
      "text": "on to for years is genuinely"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0215",
      "start": 448.24,
      "end": 452.44,
      "duration": 4.2,
      "text": "uncomfortable. More uncomfortable,"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0216",
      "start": 450.08,
      "end": 455.2,
      "duration": 5.12,
      "text": "honestly, than any bad meal. Anthony"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0217",
      "start": 452.44,
      "end": 457.4,
      "duration": 4.96,
      "text": "Bourdain spent 18 years arguing against"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0218",
      "start": 455.2,
      "end": 459.56,
      "duration": 4.36,
      "text": "this from every angle he could find. He"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0219",
      "start": 457.4,
      "end": 461.88,
      "duration": 4.48,
      "text": "built an entire career out of showing"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0220",
      "start": 459.56,
      "end": 463.92,
      "duration": 4.36,
      "text": "people what it actually looked like"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0221",
      "start": 461.88,
      "end": 466.64,
      "duration": 4.76,
      "text": "inside the places they'd written off."
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0222",
      "start": 463.92,
      "end": 468.84,
      "duration": 4.92,
      "text": "One table at a time, one meal at a time,"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0223",
      "start": 466.64,
      "end": 470.44,
      "duration": 3.8,
      "text": "and he never stopped right up until he"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0224",
      "start": 468.84,
      "end": 471.28,
      "duration": 2.44,
      "text": "did."
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0225",
      "start": 470.44,
      "end": 473.44,
      "duration": 3,
      "text": ">> You're probably going [music] to find"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0226",
      "start": 471.28,
      "end": 474.72,
      "duration": 3.44,
      "text": "out about it anyway."
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0227",
      "start": 473.44,
      "end": 477.36,
      "duration": 3.92,
      "text": "So, here's a little preemptive"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0228",
      "start": 474.72,
      "end": 480.56,
      "duration": 5.84,
      "text": "truth-telling."
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0229",
      "start": 477.36,
      "end": 480.56,
      "duration": 3.2,
      "text": "There's no happy ending."
    }
  ]
}